# AI Systems Engineering Course Website

This repository contains the source for a **Docusaurus + React** course website for:

**AI Systems Engineering**  
**Design of LLM & Multimodal AI Applications**

## Purpose

The goal of this project is to build a **production-quality, long-term maintainable course website** that combines:

- a high-fidelity custom landing page
- scalable curriculum and module pages
- reusable React UI components
- content-driven architecture using Docusaurus docs and MDX

This project should be implemented as a real, extensible course platform rather than a one-off static page.

## Source of Truth

The files in this repository should be interpreted as follows:

### 1. Landing page image
The landing-page image is the **primary visual reference**.

It defines the intended:
- layout
- visual hierarchy
- spacing
- tone
- color direction
- card structure
- overall polish

The implementation should replicate this image with **high fidelity**.

### 2. Course curriculum
The curriculum markdown file is the **primary content reference**.

It defines:
- the course title
- subtitle
- overall positioning
- modules
- themes
- structure of the course content

The course/module data model should be built from this content.

### 3. Implementation prompt
The implementation prompt defines:
- architecture expectations
- maintainability requirements
- scalability requirements
- component design requirements
- project structure guidance

This should be treated as the **technical and architectural specification**.